# ETL Data Directory

This directory contains raw spatial data files for import.

**Contents are NOT committed to git** (see .gitignore).

## Expected Directory Structure

```
etl/data/
├── ocha_hdx/
│   ├── oslo_accords_areas.shp
│   ├── oslo_accords_areas.shx
│   ├── oslo_accords_areas.dbf
│   └── oslo_accords_areas.prj
├── geomolg/
│   ├── nablus_master_plan.shp
│   ├── nablus_master_plan.shx
│   ├── nablus_master_plan.dbf
│   └── nablus_master_plan.prj
└── comps/
    └── nablus_comps_2024.csv
```

## Data Sources

- **OCHA HDX**: Download from https://data.humdata.org/dataset/oslo-accords-areas-west-bank
- **GeoMOLG**: Manual export from ArcGIS (see geomolg_etl_runbook.md)
- **Comps**: Verified market transactions from real estate agents
